# tp4/next-2 window: this is tp4-w2-kill-jobs/K-W2a-control re-pointed at the integrated image tp4-next2-1 (B0 of this pack, built from the tp4/next-2 head = tp4/octo-2 + tp4/prod-fixes); where the text below
# says tp4/prod-fixes or the window branch read tp4/next-2, and the image tag placeholder is tp4-next2-1 (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt of this pack has the order and the minutes.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the W2 kill-switch drill (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/prod-fixes (or of
# a branch that carries it) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from
# this branch by its author. ONE IMAGE FOR THE DRILL: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i "s/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/" *.env). A commit of a file the
# image carries (w2_switch.py is one) needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this drill never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# K-W2a (the CONTROL of K-W2b): the production stack WITHOUT W2 - Lever N + prefix reuse + engine reuse (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked), unaudited - on the three tests K-W2b runs: warmup, eight 3.5k-token
# code users (concurrent8_steady), eight 4k-token code users (concurrent8_code_equal), one coding answer. It is the W2-off text the kill arm is read against: every hash of every test here must equal K-W2b's.
# READ (c2_smoke_check, every rule clean): the parked build of 8 engines and every rebind clean, NO 'tp4 sdpa engaged' line, NO 'conv gates spread' line, NO '[PINDIAG] w2 kill switch' line (a leftover w2.off on the hub mount
# would show one and fail the arm). RECORD every hash (the smoke log) and the container log for K-W2b's comparison. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,coding
C2_BOX_MINUTES=60
